"en":"He said he would swallow his son."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l030","ordinal":270539,"en":"What happened now?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l031","ordinal":270540,"en":"Drain the meat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l032","ordinal":270541,"en":"Pressed by Kulchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l033","ordinal":270542,"en":"Let the circle soup,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l034","ordinal":270543,"en":"Kulchoro is spraying."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l035","ordinal":270544,"en":"The pot is boiling and the meat is not cooked"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l036","ordinal":270545,"en":"It's hard to see"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l037","ordinal":270546,"en":"Busy, people are tired,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l038","ordinal":270547,"en":"A child of the pot"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1102:b004:l039","ordinal":270548,"en":"Twelve days old."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l001","ordinal":270549,"en":"For twelve days the meat would not cook—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l002","ordinal":270550,"en":"Such a dire calamity had befallen them."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l003","ordinal":270551,"en":"Here and there the cauldron’s"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l004","ordinal":270552,"en":"Middle heaved and bulged;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l005","ordinal":270553,"en":"The rim and sides of the cauldron"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l006","ordinal":270554,"en":"Quivered almost imperceptibly;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l007","ordinal":270555,"en":"Along the cauldron’s outer edge"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l008","ordinal":270556,"en":"Blood-red foam surged and seethed."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l009","ordinal":270557,"en":"Külchoro, finest of heroes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l010","ordinal":270558,"en":"Was distraught, finding no remedy,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l011","ordinal":270559,"en":"Twisting this way and that,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l012","ordinal":270560,"en":"Despairing, “We are doomed!”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l013","ordinal":270561,"en":"Unable to find a way, Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l014","ordinal":270562,"en":"Went to his elder kinsman:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l015","ordinal":270563,"en":"“My guide upon the righteous path,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l016","ordinal":270564,"en":"My uncle, sultan of countless hosts,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l017","ordinal":270565,"en":"My ocean spring, my broad river,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l018","ordinal":270566,"en":"My steadfast khan and uncle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l019","ordinal":270567,"en":"Will you never have your fill of sleep?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l020","ordinal":270568,"en":"Will your hip not tire of lying there?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l021","ordinal":270569,"en":"There is no sentry posted on the tower—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l022","ordinal":270570,"en":"Wake from your sleep, uncle!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l023","ordinal":270571,"en":"Your former vigor is gone;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l024","ordinal":270572,"en":"Do not sleep on without cause."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l025","ordinal":270573,"en":"There is no end to your strange behavior:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l026","ordinal":270574,"en":"The broth will not boil, the meat will not cook;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l027","ordinal":270575,"en":"A day of dreadful trouble has come—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l028","ordinal":270576,"en":"What can this mean?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l029","ordinal":270577,"en":"O roaring leopard,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l030","ordinal":270578,"en":"How do you interpret this omen?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l031","ordinal":270579,"en":"The offering boils, yet the meat will not cook—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l032","ordinal":270580,"en":"How can such a thing be?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l033","ordinal":270581,"en":"Interpret this sign for me."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l034","ordinal":270582,"en":"From some long-eared elder,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l035","ordinal":270583,"en":"Have you ever heard of such a thing?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l036","ordinal":270584,"en":"From all the attentive people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l037","ordinal":270585,"en":"From one who has worn his horse’s shoulders thin,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l038","ordinal":270586,"en":"Grown old among nations and seen many peoples,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b003:l039","ordinal":270587,"en":"And journeyed around all four quarters"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l001","ordinal":270588,"en":"Of the dark earth with its hairy breast—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l002","ordinal":270589,"en":"From my aged forefather Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l003","ordinal":270590,"en":"Have you ever heard of such a deed?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l004","ordinal":270591,"en":"We kindled a fire as great as Opol-Too,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1103:b004:l005","ordinal":270592,"en":"And fed it with bent plane-tree logs;"}]
